[size=5][b][color=#3d85c6]What's New in This Version[/color][/b][/size]

Changes and Additions

[list]
[*]Near-complete rewrite of the original codebase to improve stability, reliability, and compatibility
[*]Replaced the skill tree Unity menu with a phone app and a graphical tree instead of a list (thanks again to mrell18)
[*]Reloading a save without restarting the game is supported
[*]Active skill keybinds and menu key are now user configurable
[*]Switched user configuration to use MelonPreferences, meaning [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/schedule1/mods/1222?tab=files]ModsApp[/url] (recommended) and [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/schedule1/mods/397]Mod Manager - Phone App[/url] are supported
[*]Overhauled the skill trees by adding a new tree, many new skills, unique names for skills, and improved descriptions
[*]Added the ability to merge partially empty magazines and transfer ammo between identical weapons

[/list]
